wireview-linux licensing
========================

This repository holds two kinds of code under different terms:

  1. Code written from scratch for this project, licensed under the MIT
     License (Part 1).
  2. Code and assets derived from the official WireView Pro II Windows
     application (Thermal Grizzly) and from the WireViewDeviceLib repository
     (ElmorLabs), which are not covered by the MIT License (Part 2).

A built binary that combines both (the desktop app, and WireView Mini, which
links WireViewDeviceLib) is subject to both parts.


Part 1: MIT License
-------------------

Applies to:

  - WireViewMini/
  - WireViewNet/, except WireViewNet/Services/AppSettings.cs and
    WireViewNet/Services/XdgAutostart.cs
  - packaging/, aur/, rpm/, flatpak/, nix/, flake.nix, udev/, tools/,
    install.sh
  - docs/ and README.md

